                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "109d5e3d-61d9-4b83-93c0-7165f0dc91e3",
                                "sense_id": "c6400893-8f6f-3e72-81b9-4075a5b9ece7",
                                "text": "He has dirt on a lot of powerful people; they are likely going to epstein him.",
                                "translation": "他手裡抓著很多權勢人物的黑料，他們可能要讓他“被自殺”了。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ae2bfe8-8e5d-40a0-8e10-9f0fe187f367",
                                "sense_id": "c6400893-8f6f-3e72-81b9-4075a5b9ece7",
                                "text": "not epsteined, they were after his money, he was into flakka, bet he got toasty in jail too",
                                "translation": "不是什麼“被自殺”，他們就是衝著他的錢來的，他是吸夫拉卡的，我敢打賭，他蹲號子的時候肯定也吸得暈乎乎的"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ecb7c27-2e79-4ad8-9d97-22621281b611",
                                "sense_id": "c6400893-8f6f-3e72-81b9-4075a5b9ece7",
                                "text": "If the Dominions were used to cheat the 2020 [election], I'm certain the evidence has been wiped by now. If a whistle blower popped up, they'd be epsteined by sundown.",
                                "translation": "如果Dominion[投票系统]被用来操纵2020年[大选]，我确信证据现在已经被销毁了。就算真有人举报，天黑之前也会“被自杀”了。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
