                        "sense_id": "88693bad-31e2-3bb5-9325-63b71708ddfc",
                        "entry_id": "5aba82fa-099b-32ee-b827-9a2c472c8f5a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "epstein的大小寫替代形式。"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc4ab963-ab04-4346-b2b9-ec8ed7b7e6f9",
                                "sense_id": "88693bad-31e2-3bb5-9325-63b71708ddfc",
                                "text": "[Peter W.] Smith's suicide occurred three days before the Mueller investigation began. Was he \"Epsteined\"?",
                                "translation": "彼得·W·史密斯的自杀发生在穆勒调查开始前三天。他是否也像爱泼斯坦那样“被自杀”了？"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7c97c9b-2cb1-4491-9b9b-7bf840fa94cf",
                                "sense_id": "88693bad-31e2-3bb5-9325-63b71708ddfc",
                                "text": "His [John McAfee's] prophecy about being \"Epsteined\", as some commentators are calling his death, was posted at the same time.",
                                "translation": "约翰·迈克菲关于自己会像一些评论员所说的那样“像爱泼斯坦一样‘被自杀’”的预言，也是在同一时间发布的。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32aa80e3-3b47-4a0a-9ba8-b3618b89ecda",
                                "sense_id": "88693bad-31e2-3bb5-9325-63b71708ddfc",
                                "text": "After his [Sean \"Diddy\" Combs'] arrest on charges of sex trafficking, racketeering, and organizing drug-fueled sex parties, social media erupted with fears that Combs might be \"Epsteined.\"",
                                "translation": "在他[肖恩·“迪迪”·库姆斯]因性交易、敲诈勒索和组织吸毒性派对的指控被捕后，社交媒体上爆发了对库姆斯可能“像爱泼斯坦一样‘被自杀’”的担忧。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
